{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big选X：X的大块能独立交代人物处境、原因和心理变化；Y只看加亮词时，像S10的“最舍不得的”缺少具体对象，部分屏幕也只能读出零散结论。small和core判平：两边的小字都提供了有用的情境和听感补充，全曲也都清楚保留了维护尊严与怀念旧日归属之间的反复拉扯；concise选Y，因为S11等处压缩了重复叙述，也删掉了一些大字小字几乎照说一遍的内容。human和fine选X：Y的“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”“心里的愿望向远方发出”“前进感越来越不可回避”等搭配或表达略显生硬；X的感受更常落在胸口、呼吸、脚步和身体记忆等具体体验上，Y则有不少标作感受的内容直接描述和弦、旋律和舞步。load选Y：X在S11的22秒内要扫四块较长的大字，S12的25秒也有两块长句；Y只突出关键短语，明显更容易快速扫读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c405e0b6-6028-4ce7-80cf-bdd9967b032f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T005056896444Z", "elapsed_seconds": 265.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T00:55:22.388247+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ca9b7638d83fa45cf1ea5ff95b7556cf154dfa918ac5ece8e309e2e17142d435", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7